{"title":"Career Roadmap: Cargo Executive","role":"Cargo Executive","summary":"A Cargo Executive supports the movement of goods through the air-cargo supply chain. The role can involve cargo booking, documentation, shipment coordination, warehouse operations, cargo tracking, airline/freight-forwarder coordination and customer communication.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA - Aviation Management"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in air-cargo operations, documentation, warehouse handling, freight processes, customs awareness and logistics coordination"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Cargo Executive supports the movement of goods through the air-cargo supply chain. The role can involve cargo booking, documentation, shipment coordination, warehouse operations, cargo tracking, airline/freight-forwarder coordination and customer communication."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cargo booking and acceptance"},{"text":"Shipment documentation"},{"text":"Cargo tracking"},{"text":"Warehouse coordination"},{"text":"Import/export shipment handling"},{"text":"Freight coordination"},{"text":"Airline coordination"},{"text":"Freight-forwarder coordination"},{"text":"Cargo status updates"},{"text":"Delivery coordination"},{"text":"Basic customs/compliance documentation"},{"text":"Shipment reconciliation"},{"text":"Customer service"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest skill combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aviation","Logistics","Air Cargo Operations","Documentation","Customs Awareness","ERP/IT","Business Communication"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof to Create","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business & aviation foundation"},{"text":"Management, economics, aviation basics"},{"text":"Aviation-industry report"},{"text":"Treating aviation only as passenger travel"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Logistics & cargo fundamentals"},{"text":"Supply chain, warehousing, freight"},{"text":"Cargo process case study"},{"text":"Weak documentation knowledge"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Air-cargo operations"},{"text":"Cargo handling, customs, dangerous-goods awareness, ERP"},{"text":"Air-cargo operations project"},{"text":"No operational exposure"}],[{"text":"Final Year"},{"text":"Industry readiness"},{"text":"Cargo systems, international trade, internship"},{"text":"Cargo-management capstone + internship"},{"text":"Graduating without logistics experience"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of Management"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Introduction to Aviation"},{"text":"Aviation Industry Structure"},{"text":"Excel fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aviation Management"},{"text":"Airport Operations"},{"text":"Business Statistics"},{"text":"Logistics Fundamentals"},{"text":"Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"Customer Service"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Air Cargo Management"},{"text":"Cargo Operations"},{"text":"Warehousing"},{"text":"Freight Forwarding"},{"text":"International Trade"},{"text":"Import/Export Documentation"},{"text":"ERP fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Air Cargo Handling"},{"text":"Cargo Security"},{"text":"Customs & Trade Compliance"},{"text":"Dangerous Goods awareness"},{"text":"Inventory Management"},{"text":"Transportation Management"},{"text":"Power BI basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International Air Logistics"},{"text":"Cargo Revenue & Pricing"},{"text":"Cargo Capacity Planning"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analytics"},{"text":"Aviation Information Systems"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Industry internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced cargo operations"},{"text":"Cargo analytics"},{"text":"Airport/airline cargo processes"},{"text":"Internship/project"},{"text":"Cargo-management capstone"},{"text":"Professional certifications"},{"text":"Interview preparation"}]}]},{"heading":"Air Cargo Industry Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the air-cargo ecosystem:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Shipper","Freight Forwarder","Cargo Terminal/Ground Handler","Airline","Destination Handler","Customs","Consignee"]},{"type":"p","text":"Important stakeholders include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shippers"},{"text":"Consignees"},{"text":"Airlines"},{"text":"Freight forwarders"},{"text":"Customs authorities"},{"text":"Ground handlers"},{"text":"Cargo terminal operators"},{"text":"Customs brokers"},{"text":"Warehouses"},{"text":"Transporters"},{"text":"Airport authorities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"p","text":"Airline Cargo Operations\nand\nFreight Forwarding Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"A cargo executive may work on either side of this ecosystem."}]},{"heading":"Air Cargo Process","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the end-to-end process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Booking","Documentation","Cargo Acceptance","Security Screening","Warehouse Handling","Build-up","Aircraft Loading","Flight","Destination Handling","Customs Clearance","Delivery"]},{"type":"p","text":"For imports:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Flight Arrival","Breakdown","Warehouse","Customs","Release","Delivery"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn where delays can occur:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Incorrect documentation"},{"text":"Customs issues"},{"text":"Security screening"},{"text":"Capacity constraints"},{"text":"Flight delays"},{"text":"Handling issues"},{"text":"Incorrect packaging"},{"text":"Missing permits"},{"text":"Warehouse congestion"}]}]},{"heading":"Cargo Documentation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong documentation skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Important documents/concepts include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Air Waybill (AWB)"},{"text":"House Air Waybill (HAWB)"},{"text":"Master Air Waybill (MAWB)"},{"text":"Commercial invoice"},{"text":"Packing list"},{"text":"Certificate of origin"},{"text":"Shipping instructions"},{"text":"Cargo manifest"},{"text":"Export/import declarations"},{"text":"Delivery documentation"},{"text":"Customs documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Air Waybill"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand that an AWB is a key air-cargo transport document containing shipment information such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shipper"},{"text":"Consignee"},{"text":"Origin"},{"text":"Destination"},{"text":"Pieces"},{"text":"Weight"},{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Commodity"},{"text":"Handling information"},{"text":"Freight details"}]}]},{"heading":"Cargo Classification","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how cargo is classified and handled."},{"type":"h","text":"General Cargo"},{"type":"p","text":"Ordinary commercial goods."},{"type":"h","text":"Special Cargo"},{"type":"p","text":"Examples include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Perishable cargo"},{"text":"Pharmaceuticals"},{"text":"Live animals"},{"text":"Valuable cargo"},{"text":"Human remains"},{"text":"Temperature-sensitive cargo"},{"text":"Dangerous goods"},{"text":"Oversized cargo"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Each category can have specific handling, packaging, documentation and regulatory requirements."}]},{"heading":"Dangerous Goods Awareness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Dangerous goods are a critical area in air cargo."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Packaging"},{"text":"Labelling"},{"text":"Marking"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Acceptance checks"},{"text":"Handling"},{"text":"Storage"},{"text":"Emergency procedures"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations (DGR) framework and relevant aviation safety requirements."},{"type":"p","text":"A general BBA degree does not by itself authorize a person to perform regulated dangerous-goods functions. Job-specific training, certification and employer authorization may be required."},{"type":"p","text":"Do not treat dangerous-goods handling as an area where informal knowledge is sufficient."}]},{"heading":"Cargo Weight & Measurement","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gross weight"},{"text":"Net weight"},{"text":"Chargeable weight"},{"text":"Volumetric weight"},{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Unit conversions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A basic volumetric-weight concept for air freight is commonly based on:"},{"type":"h","text":"Length × Width × Height ÷ applicable dimensional factor"},{"type":"p","text":"The exact divisor and charging rules depend on the applicable carrier/tariff/system, so operational staff must follow the current airline/freight-forwarder rules."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand why:"},{"type":"h","text":"Actual Weight vs Volumetric Weight"},{"type":"p","text":"can affect freight charges."}]},{"heading":"Freight & Cargo Pricing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the components of cargo cost:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Freight rate"},{"text":"Fuel-related charges"},{"text":"Security charges"},{"text":"Handling charges"},{"text":"Terminal charges"},{"text":"Documentation fees"},{"text":"Customs-related costs"},{"text":"Storage"},{"text":"Delivery charges"},{"text":"Special handling charges"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the difference between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Freight Cost ≠ Total Landed/Delivered Cost"},{"type":"p","text":"For international shipments, total cost can include multiple logistics and regulatory components."}]},{"heading":"International Trade & Customs","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build awareness of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Import/export process"},{"text":"HS codes"},{"text":"Customs valuation"},{"text":"Duties"},{"text":"Taxes"},{"text":"Country of origin"},{"text":"Import restrictions"},{"text":"Export controls"},{"text":"Licences/permits"},{"text":"Customs declarations"},{"text":"Customs brokers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"India Ecosystem"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the broad roles of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customs"},{"text":"Ministry of Civil Aviation"},{"text":"DGCA"},{"text":"Airports"},{"text":"Airlines"},{"text":"Freight forwarders"},{"text":"Customs brokers"},{"text":"DGFT"},{"text":"RBI in relevant trade/payment contexts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual customs and trade requirements vary by commodity, country and current regulations."}]},{"heading":"Incoterms","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the major Incoterms concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EXW"},{"text":"FCA"},{"text":"CPT"},{"text":"CIP"},{"text":"DAP"},{"text":"DPU"},{"text":"DDP"},{"text":"FAS"},{"text":"FOB"},{"text":"CFR"},{"text":"CIF"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Who arranges transportation?"},{"text":"Who pays which costs?"},{"text":"When does risk transfer?"},{"text":"Who handles export/import responsibilities?"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Incoterms are particularly useful when coordinating with exporters, importers and freight forwarders."}]},{"heading":"Cargo Warehouse Operations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Receiving","Inspection","Weighing","Security Screening","Storage","Documentation","Build-up/Breakdown","Dispatch"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cargo acceptance"},{"text":"Cargo storage"},{"text":"Palletization"},{"text":"ULDs"},{"text":"Build-up"},{"text":"Breakdown"},{"text":"Cargo segregation"},{"text":"Temperature-controlled storage"},{"text":"Inventory control"},{"text":"Warehouse safety"},{"text":"Cargo security"}]},{"type":"h","text":"ULD"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the role of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pallets"},{"text":"Containers"},{"text":"Aircraft-compatible Unit Load Devices"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how ULD planning supports efficient aircraft cargo loading."}]},{"heading":"Cargo Tracking & Shipment Control","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Booking status"},{"text":"Cargo acceptance"},{"text":"Warehouse receipt"},{"text":"Flight number"},{"text":"Departure"},{"text":"Arrival"},{"text":"Customs status"},{"text":"Delivery status"},{"text":"Exceptions"},{"text":"Delays"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful operational metrics:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"On-time shipment"},{"text":"Transit time"},{"text":"Cargo dwell time"},{"text":"Shipment damage"},{"text":"Misrouting"},{"text":"Cargo discrepancy"},{"text":"Warehouse turnaround"},{"text":"Delivery performance"}]}]},{"heading":"Cargo Security","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cargo screening"},{"text":"Access control"},{"text":"Secure storage"},{"text":"Chain of custody"},{"text":"Documentation integrity"},{"text":"Tamper prevention"},{"text":"Security declarations"},{"text":"Known/regulated cargo concepts where applicable"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Security procedures vary by jurisdiction and role, so operational practice must follow the applicable airport, airline and regulatory requirements."}]},{"heading":"Supply Chain Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Connect air cargo with the wider supply chain."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supplier","Manufacturing","Warehouse","Transportation","Airport","Air Cargo","Destination","Distribution","Customer"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Warehousing"},{"text":"Transportation"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Demand planning"},{"text":"Order fulfilment"},{"text":"Reverse logistics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Air cargo is often selected when speed, reliability or product value justifies its higher cost compared with slower transport modes."}]},{"heading":"Logistics Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop awareness of:"},{"type":"h","text":"ERP"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP"},{"text":"Oracle"},{"text":"Microsoft Dynamics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Logistics Systems"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Warehouse Management Systems"},{"text":"Transportation Management Systems"},{"text":"Cargo Management Systems"},{"text":"Freight-forwarding software"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tracking"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Barcode"},{"text":"QR"},{"text":"RFID"},{"text":"GPS"},{"text":"IoT"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["booking","handling","transportation","delivery"],"label":"The objective is to understand how shipment information moves from"}]},{"heading":"Cargo Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"IF/IFERROR"},{"text":"PivotTables"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Charts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shipment volume"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Cargo weight"},{"text":"Destination"},{"text":"Airline"},{"text":"Customer"},{"text":"On-time performance"},{"text":"Delays"},{"text":"Warehouse dwell time"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"p","text":"SELECT"},{"type":"p","text":"WHERE"},{"type":"p","text":"GROUP BY"},{"type":"p","text":"HAVING"},{"type":"p","text":"ORDER BY"},{"type":"p","text":"CASE"},{"type":"p","text":"JOIN"},{"type":"p","text":"CTEs"},{"type":"p","text":"Subqueries"},{"type":"p","text":"Window Functions"}]},{"heading":"Projects to Build","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Air Cargo Shipment Tracking System"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a dataset containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWB number"},{"text":"Customer"},{"text":"Origin"},{"text":"Destination"},{"text":"Commodity"},{"text":"Weight"},{"text":"Flight"},{"text":"Booking date"},{"text":"Departure"},{"text":"Arrival"},{"text":"Customs status"},{"text":"Delivery status"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a dashboard showing shipment status and delays."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Air Cargo Cost Calculator"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a model considering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Actual weight"},{"text":"Volumetric weight"},{"text":"Freight rate"},{"text":"Handling"},{"text":"Fuel/security charges"},{"text":"Storage"},{"text":"Delivery"},{"text":"Other applicable charges"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Compare shipment costs across routes."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Cargo Operations Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cargo volume"},{"text":"Weight"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Destination"},{"text":"Customer"},{"text":"Flight"},{"text":"On-time performance"},{"text":"Warehouse dwell time"},{"text":"Exception rate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel + Power BI"}]},{"heading":"Advanced Capstone Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Air Cargo Management & Logistics Intelligence Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simulated system combining:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cargo Booking","Documentation","Tracking","Warehouse","Custo